# All runs Linux x86 (this container), release build, < 100 MB mem, each <= 9 s.
# Build: CARGO_TARGET_DIR=/tmp/x-target cargo build --release -p emergent-encounters --bin cross
# Binary: crates/encounters/src/bin/cross.rs (copy: cross.rs in this folder)
# rho=1e-4, safety=1.5. Swarm A: a=1 hw 1e-5, Rayleigh e~0.001, pom +-0.1, lambda U.
# Swarm B: a=1.2 e=0.3 pom=0 hw same (pericentre 0.84, apocentre 1.56; crosses r=1 at +-1.259 rad).

$ cross fleet
